sad-web-push
Copyright 2026 Sadco Security Team

This project is a maintained fork of the web-push crate, providing both a
0.11.x maintenance line (retaining the http 0.2 API) and a modernized 0.12.x
release line with pure-Rust cryptography, Rustls default transport, security
hardening, and protocol improvements.

